flowchart TD
    A["输入<br>上一轮 fixed-lag useful-window 结论"]:::prev
    A --> B["本轮变量<br>support world-coordinate noise<br>0.00 / 0.10 / 0.25 / 0.50m"]:::current
    B --> C["测量门<br>primary clean<br>drop invariant<br>truth clean<br>pose0 reproduces prior"]:::gate
    C --> D{"通过?"}:::gate
    D -->|否| X["inconclusive<br>不解释指标"]:::fail
    D -->|是| E["只看 high useful-window<br>窗口足够时再看噪声"]:::current

    E --> F["0.00m<br>fixed2 delta 0.818<br>fixed3 delta 0.672"]:::pass
    E --> G["0.10m<br>fixed2 delta 0.107<br>fixed3 delta 0.095"]:::pass
    E --> H["0.25m<br>survival delta 转负<br>IDSW 高于 drop"]:::partial
    E --> I["0.50m<br>基本没有可用收益"]:::fail

    F --> J["结论<br>temporal_spatial_boundary_identified"]:::decision
    G --> J
    H --> J
    I --> J

    J --> K["含义<br>时间窗口足够仍可能失败<br>因为坐标噪声污染回放更新"]:::summary
    K --> L["下一步<br>message content / identity cue ablation"]:::next
    K --> M["工程改进<br>formal runner 需要 checkpoint/resume"]:::next

